## Write in whatever editor you like

:::{style="margin-top: 30px; font-size: 24px;"}
:::{.columns}
:::{.column width="50%"}
- A `.qmd` file is [plain text]{.alert}. VS Code, RStudio, Jupyter Lab, Neovim, or Notepad: they all work
